rse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja466:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja466:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja466:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja466:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja466:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja466:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja466:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja466:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja466:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja466:0.4": "3. Samuddavāṇijajātaka ", "ja466:1.1": "“Kasanti vapanti te janā, ", "ja466:1.2": "Manujā kammaphalūpajīvino; ", "ja466:1.3": "Nayimassa dīpakassa bhāgino, ", "ja466:1.4": "Jambudīpā idameva no varaṁ”. ", "ja466:2.1": "“Tipañcarattūpagatamhi cande, ", "ja466:2.2": "Vego mahā hehiti sāgarassa; ", "ja466:2.3": "Uplavissaṁ dīpamimaṁ uḷāraṁ, ", "ja466:2.4": "Mā vo vadhī gacchatha leṇamaññaṁ”. ", "ja466:3.1": "“Na jātuyaṁ sāgaravārivego, ", "ja466:3.2": "Uplavissaṁ dīpamimaṁ uḷāraṁ; ", "ja466:3.3": "Taṁ me nimittehi bahūhi diṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja466:3.4": "Mā bhetha kiṁ socatha modathavho. ", "ja466:4.1": "Pahūtabhakkhaṁ bahuannapānaṁ, ", "ja466:4.2": "Pattattha āvāsamimaṁ uḷāraṁ; ", "ja466:4.3": "Na vo bhayaṁ paṭipassāmi kiñci, ", "ja466:4.4": "Āputtaputtehi pamodathavho”. ", "ja466:5.1": "“Yo devoyaṁ dakkhiṇāyaṁ disāyaṁ, ", "ja466:5.2": "Khemanti pakkosati tassa saccaṁ; ", "ja466:5.3": "Na uttaro vedi bhayābhayassa, ", "ja466:5.4": "Mā bhetha kiṁ socatha modathavho”. ", "ja466:6.1": "“Yathā ime vippavadanti yakkhā, ", "ja466:6.2": "Eko bhayaṁ saṁsati khemameko; ", "ja466:6.3": "Tadiṅgha mayhaṁ vacanaṁ suṇātha, ", "ja466:6.4": "Khippaṁ lahuṁ mā vinassimha sabbe. ", "ja466:7.1": "Sabbe samāgamma karoma nāvaṁ, ", "ja466:7.2": "Doṇiṁ daḷhaṁ sabbayantūpapannaṁ; ", "ja466:7.3": "Sace ayaṁ dakkhiṇo saccamāha, ", "ja466:7.4": "Moghaṁ paṭikkosati uttaroyaṁ; ", "ja466:7.5": "Sā ceva no hehiti āpadatthā, ", "ja466:7.6": "Imañca dīpaṁ na pariccajema. ", "ja466:8.1": "Sace ca kho uttaro saccamāha, ", "ja466:8.2": "Moghaṁ paṭikkosati dakkhiṇoyaṁ; ", "ja466:8.3": "Tameva nāvaṁ abhiruyha sabbe, ", "ja466:8.4": "Evaṁ mayaṁ sotthi taremu pāraṁ. ", "ja466:9.1": "Na ve sugaṇhaṁ paṭhamena seṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja466:9.2": "Kaniṭṭhamāpāthagataṁ gahetvā; ", "ja466:9.3": "Yo cīdha tacchaṁ paviceyya gaṇhati, ", "ja466:9.4": "Sa ve naro seṭṭhamupeti ṭhānaṁ. ", "ja466:10.1": "Yathāpi te sāgaravārimajjhe, ", "ja466:10.2": "Sakammunā sotthi vahiṁsu vāṇijā; ", "ja466:10.3": "Anāgatatthaṁ paṭivijjhiyāna, ", "ja466:10.4": "Appampi nācceti sa bhūripañño. ", "ja466:11.1": "Bālā ca mohena rasānugiddhā, ", "ja466:11.2": "Anāgataṁ appaṭivijjhiyatthaṁ; ", "ja466:11.3": "Paccuppanne sīdanti atthajāte, ", "ja466:11.4": "Samuddamajjhe yathā te manussā. ", "ja466:12.1": "Anāgataṁ paṭikayirātha kiccaṁ, ", "ja466:12.2": "‘Mā maṁ kiccaṁ kiccakāle byadhesi’; ", "ja466:12.3": "Taṁ tādisaṁ paṭikatakiccakāriṁ, ", "ja466:12.4": "Na taṁ kiccaṁ kiccakāle byadhetī”ti. ", "ja466:13.1": "Samuddavāṇijajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja466:0.1": "", "ja466:0.2": "", "ja466:0.3": "", "ja466:0.4": "", "ja466:1.1": "", "ja466:1.2": "", "ja466:1.3": "", "ja466:1.4": "", "ja466:2.1": "", "ja466:2.2": "", "ja466:2.3": "", "ja466:2.4": "", "ja466:3.1": "", "ja466:3.2": "", "ja466:3.3": "", "ja466:3.4": "modathavho → modatha vo (mr) ", "ja466:4.1": "", "ja466:4.2": "", "ja466:4.3": "", "ja466:4.4": "", "ja466:5.1": "dakkhiṇāyaṁ → dakkhiṇassaṁ (bj) ", "ja46